541,576,545,575,566,598,571,548,548,635,703,845,868,776,813,850,803,779,774,713,713,751,741,746,741,784,793,850,830,830,820,740,775,765,755,745,745,740,700,700],"v":[1919900,2319200,2124700,5587900,3533700,3467600,1507200,2022400,4856400,13506100,3826100,5011900,5923000,17458800,6682100,82656900,52416100,27693000,64379100,68849100,30052800,7689600,8923100,3323300,1960100,4337600,3028100,5623600,3491500,5347200,2440400,3365600,2253600,3108700,5895300,4809700,4526000,24883600,9369200,7489600,38667300,22153500,17812300,17906800,21682800,10810900,17228200,76010300,235198400,163163700,183771200,107410600,123997100,206746100,134727000,54396900,18850500,64097500,109345000,48734400,19145600,22494000,48634700,24745200,17720000,23533800,73689100,17072500,53628200,288688300,137337000,205487200,105095700,43123800,32162100,27983600,54700500,22580600,31238700,19113000,16475900,52024300,14988200,18098500,12994900,15927900,8105000,9288800,6678000,22418900,57281300,109097500,85701400,39791800,22468300,22609900,30077400,8231400,6076400,5415700,3882300,3820700,2762500,4102600,2730400,7425200,11711100,11513700,6257500,3765900,2278400,3963200,1616600,2181300,2044000,1607900,2279900,1789800,2347000,1116300]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.shinyanggroup.com.my","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Marine Shipping","employees":null,"city":"Miri","summary":"Shin Yang Group Berhad, an investment holding company, offers shipping, shipbuilding, and ship repair services in Malaysia and internationally. The company transports loose bulk and container cargoes, such as timber logs, sawn timber, plywood, quarry, cement, glue, lubricants, project cargoes, car containers, timber products, light equipment, heavy machineries, vehicles, metal plates, steel products, flour, spare parts, and other cargoes; general cargoes, including machineries, timber and steel products, and others; and aggregates comprising limestone, quarry, armour rocks, core, gabbro, and clinker, as well as charters and ships. It also builds tugboats, cargo vessels, anchor handling tugs, navy training vessels, landing crafts, platform supply vessels, workboats, barges, seismic support vessels, floating docks, pneumatic cement carriers, and escort tugs. In addition, the company offers ship repair services, such as slipways and floating dock, berthing and lay up, and pilot tug and towing; general services; zinc anode renewal and supply; hydraulic testing; load test; steering gear and rudder assembly repair; propeller, shaft, and stern tube seal repair; anchor chain and anchor works; chain locker cleaning; aluminum/steel hull repair and renewal; tanks cleaning; sea chest and piping renewal; valve service and supply; schedule waste disposal; engine and generator overhaul; supply UV monitoring repair; electrical system test; and wiring, cleaning, and repair services. Further, it fabricates steel structures, frames, and parts for metal bridges, factories and warehouses, and jetties; metal buoy; and helideck, as well as engages in property holding business. The company was formerly known as Shin Yang Shipping Corporation Berhad and changed its name to Shin Yang Group Berhad in July 2023. The company was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Miri, Malaysia. Shin Yang Group Berhad is a subsidiary of Shin Yang Holding Sendirian Berhad.","zh":"Shin Yang Group Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，提供航运、造船和修船服务，业务覆盖马来西亚及国际市场。公司成立于2004年，总部位于马来西亚美里，是 Shin Yang Holding Sendirian Berhad 的子公司。","lines":["航运服务：运输散装和集装箱货物，包括木材原木、锯材、胶合板、石材、水泥、胶水、润滑油、项目货物、汽车集装箱、木制品、轻型设备、重型机械、车辆、金属板、钢材、面粉、备件等，以及普通货物和骨料（石灰石、采石场石料、护面石、岩芯、辉长岩和熟料），并提供船舶租赁和船舶管理服务。","造船业务：建造拖船、货船、锚作拖船、海军训练舰、登陆艇、平台供应船、工作船、驳船、地震支持船、浮船坞、气动水泥运输船和护航拖船。","修船服务：提供滑道和浮船坞、停泊和闲置、引航拖船和拖曳、一般服务、锌阳极更换和供应、液压测试、负载测试、舵机与舵组件维修、螺旋桨/轴/尾管密封维修、锚链和锚工程、锚链舱清洁、铝/钢船体维修与更换、油罐清洁、海水箱和管道更换、阀门服务和供应、废物处理、发动机和发电机大修、UV监测维修、电气系统测试以及布线、清洁和维修服务。","钢结构制造：制造用于金属桥梁、工厂和仓库、码头的钢结构、框架和零件，以及金属浮标和直升机甲板。",""],"lines_en":["Shipping services: transports loose bulk and container cargoes (e.g., timber logs, sawn timber, plywood, quarry, cement, glue, lubricants, project cargoes, car containers, timber products, light equipment, heavy machineries, vehicles, metal plates, steel products, flour, spare parts), general cargoes, and aggregates (limestone, quarry, armour rocks, core, gabbro, clinker); also provides chartering and ship management.","Shipbuilding: builds tugboats, cargo vessels, anchor handling tugs, navy training vessels, landing crafts, platform supply vessels, workboats, barges, seismic support vessels, floating docks, pneumatic cement carriers, and escort tugs.","Ship repair services: offers slipways and floating dock, berthing and lay up, pilot tug and towing, general services, zinc anode renewal and supply, hydraulic testing, load test, steering gear and rudder assembly repair, propeller/shaft/stern tube seal repair, anchor chain and anchor works, chain locker cleaning, aluminum/steel hull repair and renewal, tanks cleaning, sea chest and piping renewal, valve service and supply, schedule waste disposal, engine and generator overhaul, UV monitoring repair, electrical system test, and wiring, cleaning, and repair services.","Steel structure fabrication: fabricates steel structures, frames, and parts for metal bridges, factories and warehouses, and jetties; metal buoy; and helideck.","Property holding: engages in property holding business."]}}